## Vendored skills

Copied from upstream repositories by `scripts/sync-external-skills.js`, which
records the source URL and content hash of each in `scripts/external-skills.json`.
Update them from upstream rather than editing them here.

| Skills                     | Source                                          | License                        |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| `spacetimedb-*` (20)       | https://github.com/DanMossa/spacetimedb-skills  | no license file upstream (see below) |
| `clerk-*` (8)              | https://github.com/clerk/skills                 | no license file upstream (see below) |
| `upstash`                  | https://github.com/upstash/skills               | MIT                            |
| `agent-reach`              | https://github.com/Panniantong/agent-reach      | MIT                            |

**Two upstreams publish no license file.** `clerk/skills` and
`DanMossa/spacetimedb-skills` are public and plainly meant to be installed, but
neither states terms, so by default no redistribution right is granted. They are
vendored here because a symlink cannot survive a clone and the skills are useless
without their content. If you are one of those authors and would rather this
repository not carry a copy, open an issue and it will be removed the same day.
Anyone redistributing this repository further should check those upstreams first.

`skills/humanizer/` is derived from Wikipedia's "Signs of AI writing" guide,
available under CC BY-SA 4.0.

## Not covered here

`plugins/installed_plugins.json` and `plugins/known_marketplaces.json` are
lockfiles naming external plugins by version and commit. No plugin code is
vendored into this repository; those trees live in the git-ignored
`plugins/cache/`.
